%), which means steady shortages. Candidate 5 orders 125%, about 8 units a day above average demand. That extra builds up and eventually spoils, costing about 88 a day.\n   - Product 1: a missing unit costs 13 and a spare unit costs about 7, since it keeps only 4 days. That points to ordering roughly 110% of forecast. Candidate 2's 130% for product 1 is too much.\n\nCandidate 4 combines the cheaper schedule with the right quantities. Candidate 0 orders the same amounts every day and pays about 450 more in fees."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 5109, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2269, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 5109}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-12T19:16:13.315Z", "request_id": "req_011CfxsuPd93qMz7yUN2rjPL"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01RJKp9ZGTFZNdtUfKPpegsN", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CfxsuPyDqP6JbjK9oRzzQ", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01RJKp9ZGTFZNdtUfKPpegsN", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"choice": 4}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 5109, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2269, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 5109}, "out